{"sections":[{"slug":"椭圆算子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"椭圆算子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆算子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"椭圆算子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/线性微分算子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">线性微分算子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D\\colon \\Gamma(E)\\to \\Gamma(F)$, <span lang=\"zh\">若其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/象征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">象征</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\sigma(D)(w)\\colon E_p\\to F_p$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">为椭圆算子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">椭圆算子的推广是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆复形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}